### Get all customers (Admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get one customer (Admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/customers/REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Delete a customer (Admin only)
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/customers/dba93c6c-a760-4024-b517-659a4d8a3f99
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}